WEBVTT

00:00:29.240 --> 00:00:29.400
Thank you for watching.

00:00:31.440 --> 00:00:32.520
I want to ask you something

00:00:32.520 --> 00:00:33.530
What is it?

00:00:34.620 --> 00:00:37.980
You are the one who stabbed Li Guang in Jiuzhou

00:00:37.980 --> 00:00:42.990
That's right

00:00:45.310 --> 00:00:48.870
You are also the one who killed 108 people at the three escort offices

00:00:48.870 --> 00:00:51.510
Who are you?

00:00:51.570 --> 00:00:53.510
My name is Meng Xinhun

00:00:53.510 --> 00:00:59.470
I invited you here tonight because someone gave me money to kill you

00:01:01.150 --> 00:01:12.600
The killer in the martial arts world is like a shooting star in the sky

00:01:12.600 --> 00:01:14.700
When it appears, it shines brightly

00:01:14.700 --> 00:01:16.700
But it will disappear in a moment

00:01:16.700 --> 00:01:18.310
And it has no name

00:01:31.148 --> 00:01:33.148
Oh

00:02:05.330 --> 00:02:05.690
Your Majesty!

00:02:05.690 --> 00:02:06.410
in the meantime, okay?

00:02:06.990 --> 00:02:07.350
I never thought

00:02:07.790 --> 00:02:08.150
Listen,

00:02:24.740 --> 00:02:26.290
I've been behind K Kelvin's side

00:02:36.580 --> 00:02:37.770
And who did you kill?

00:02:38.190 --> 00:02:39.000
You can see it on the table.

00:03:10.490 --> 00:03:10.930
Hurry up.

00:03:11.530 --> 00:03:12.110
Hurry up.

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:44.920
A killer has no life, but he has a life.

00:03:46.330 --> 00:03:48.020
Everyone knows that in Cangchun Hospital,

00:03:48.200 --> 00:03:50.260
as long as you have money, you can buy anything.

00:03:50.360 --> 00:03:52.800
You can even buy a life.

00:03:53.120 --> 00:03:55.640
Why me again?

00:03:55.640 --> 00:03:57.840
Who else?

00:03:57.980 --> 00:03:59.820
Second, Yue Qiang.

00:04:00.860 --> 00:04:07.280
Ye Xiang, that drunkard, now only knows how to drink

00:04:07.280 --> 00:04:12.800
Open it and take a look

00:04:17.080 --> 00:04:21.040
That's right, he is Sun Yubo from Longmen Gang, the largest gang in Jianghu

00:04:21.600 --> 00:04:24.930
Longmen Bao is located on Qinglong Mountain by the Taihu River

00:04:24.930 --> 00:04:27.960
It's 300 miles long and has a price of tens of thousands of yuan

00:04:27.960 --> 00:04:29.700
Yibo has a son

00:04:29.700 --> 00:04:29.880
It's a

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:32.610
His name is Sun Jian. He is very strong and has great martial arts skills.

00:04:32.610 --> 00:04:35.320
He once went to three waterfalls in one night.

00:04:35.320 --> 00:04:39.650
But the one who was the most successful was not his son,

00:04:39.990 --> 00:04:41.250
but a man named Lv Xiang Chuan.

00:04:41.490 --> 00:04:43.240
He was armed with 72 weapons.

00:04:43.660 --> 00:04:44.670
His martial arts skills were incredible.

00:04:45.170 --> 00:04:50.320
In addition, there was a mysterious killer named Han Tang.

00:04:50.870 --> 00:04:54.100
No one knew where he was, but everyone knew that he could kill anyone.

00:04:55.090 --> 00:04:58.710
Next month, the 15th, is the 50th birthday of Lao Bo.

00:04:58.710 --> 00:04:59.800
No.12

00:05:00.220 --> 00:05:01.180
Go and see for yourself.

00:05:36.140 --> 00:05:37.960
Good, good, good

00:05:40.120 --> 00:05:42.550
Uncle Lu, where is Lao Bo?

00:05:43.070 --> 00:05:44.530
He and Brother Han are inside

00:05:45.230 --> 00:05:48.650
Even Han Tang, who has never seen him before, is here

00:05:48.650 --> 00:05:51.330
Master of North Hill, Yi Qianlong is here

00:05:52.410 --> 00:05:55.170
Hello, hello

00:06:00.160 --> 00:06:00.860
We haven't seen each other for 11 years.

00:06:01.360 --> 00:06:04.220
Of course, I'm in the south and you're in the north.

00:06:04.300 --> 00:06:05.420
We're a team.

00:06:06.100 --> 00:06:06.460
Help!

00:06:10.360 --> 00:06:11.660
What's wrong?

00:06:13.080 --> 00:06:14.370
Sun Jian, save me.

00:06:15.000 --> 00:06:16.120
What's going on?

00:06:16.280 --> 00:06:17.900
He killed his master's family.

00:06:18.900 --> 00:06:21.220
No, I didn't kill anyone.

00:06:21.360 --> 00:06:22.560
You don't have to be afraid.

00:06:22.600 --> 00:06:25.070
No one dares to touch you or Han Mao here.

00:06:25.860 --> 00:06:28.210
You shouldn't have said that.

00:06:28.230 --> 00:06:28.510
Why?

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:30.620
What should I not say?

00:06:31.370 --> 00:06:32.290
Because no matter where he goes,

00:06:32.830 --> 00:06:34.520
we have to take him away.

00:06:34.940 --> 00:06:37.390
No, Xiaotie is my friend.

00:06:37.570 --> 00:06:40.780
No one can take him away from me.

00:06:41.260 --> 00:06:42.600
Let's talk to your father.

00:06:42.840 --> 00:06:43.810
I want to talk to him.

00:06:44.590 --> 00:06:45.830
My father's words are the same.

00:06:46.600 --> 00:06:49.870
I think he doesn't dare to be so rude to the three friends of Huangshan.

00:06:50.330 --> 00:06:51.450
You are wrong.

00:06:51.650 --> 00:06:59.500
He is rude to his father.

00:07:00.160 --> 00:07:01.720
Maybe more rude than him

00:07:01.720 --> 00:07:04.190
How do you know?

00:07:04.640 --> 00:07:06.830
Because I am his father

00:07:06.830 --> 00:07:13.320
Uncle Jiuwen is always fair

00:07:13.320 --> 00:07:16.540
Why did you cover up the murderer today?

00:07:16.540 --> 00:07:18.220
No, they are the murderer

00:07:18.220 --> 00:07:19.820
I have evidence

00:07:20.880 --> 00:07:24.660
This cloth was torn from him

00:07:24.660 --> 00:07:24.980
It's the same as his

00:07:35.530 --> 00:07:37.700
If you offend your wife, you will die

00:07:37.700 --> 00:07:59.290
Everyone, listen

00:08:00.220 --> 00:08:04.000
If you want to kill my wife, then kill me first!

00:08:04.180 --> 00:08:09.770
My wife is here.

00:08:10.250 --> 00:08:12.010
If anything happens, she will be fair.

00:08:12.510 --> 00:08:18.200
Tie Chenggang will stay with us.

00:08:18.420 --> 00:08:19.660
Xiangchuan.

00:08:19.760 --> 00:08:20.020
Yes.

00:08:20.260 --> 00:08:21.500
You take care of him.

00:08:21.760 --> 00:08:22.900
Yes, my wife.

00:08:23.000 --> 00:08:24.710
As for the old man from Yangliu Village,

00:08:25.790 --> 00:08:27.290
there is a group of bandits.

00:08:27.450 --> 00:08:29.420
They have been killing people and setting off fires.

00:08:30.440 --> 00:08:31.800
Song Jian.

00:08:31.940 --> 00:08:32.180
Yes.

00:08:32.960 --> 00:08:35.280
Go and clean them up tomorrow.

00:08:35.600 --> 00:08:36.640
Yes, father.

00:09:10.590 --> 00:09:11.960
Hurry up and leave!

00:09:13.270 --> 00:09:14.940
Hurry up and leave!

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:32.000
Thanks for watching!

00:10:00.120 --> 00:10:00.700
Who are those three people?

00:10:01.360 --> 00:10:05.100
Those three people are the ones who killed Guanxi and Sanhu

00:10:06.110 --> 00:10:07.960
Guanxi and Sanhu?

00:10:08.120 --> 00:10:12.960
Guanxi and Sanhu are the special guards of the Four Great Guards of the Flying Rocs Gang

00:10:12.960 --> 00:10:20.170
I heard that the Flying Rocs Gang has been in contact with many clans lately

00:10:20.170 --> 00:10:21.860
They are very powerful

00:10:21.890 --> 00:10:27.480
That's right. Now they have branches in 12 cities in Jiangnan

00:10:27.480 --> 00:10:29.860
And Lord Wanpeng is also a very loyal...

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:32.250
There are powerful people in both the dark and the light.

00:10:34.640 --> 00:10:37.600
Is there anyone in the 12th Flying Rocs Gang?

00:10:39.450 --> 00:10:41.190
There are people with wives all over the world.

00:10:41.920 --> 00:10:45.280
Xiang Chuan, what if I let you do this?

00:10:45.970 --> 00:10:48.560
The wives that need to be killed are the ones that should be killed.

00:10:49.180 --> 00:10:50.420
And they will definitely be able to kill them.

00:11:17.600 --> 00:11:17.860
Who are you?

00:11:17.880 --> 00:11:22.190
Master Wan

00:11:22.190 --> 00:11:25.290
You are Gu Huaxuan's new friend?

00:11:25.510 --> 00:11:25.790
No

00:11:26.490 --> 00:11:27.170
You...

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:30.680
Then why did you come here?

00:11:30.960 --> 00:11:32.280
Because I have something to do to see the master

00:11:32.280 --> 00:11:33.650
Unfortunately, there is no way

00:11:33.650 --> 00:11:35.540
Later, I inquired about the master

00:11:35.540 --> 00:11:38.160
He likes to come to Luoyang Gu Huaxuan to buy antiques

00:11:38.160 --> 00:11:40.670
So I bought Gu Huaxuan first

00:11:40.670 --> 00:11:42.130
Ask to see the master

00:11:42.130 --> 00:11:47.060
You are not simple

00:11:47.060 --> 00:11:48.490
What's your surname?

00:11:48.730 --> 00:11:50.210
My surname is Lv Bo

00:11:50.870 --> 00:11:55.580
I heard that Sun Yubo's most powerful assistant

00:11:55.580 --> 00:11:57.660
Not his son

00:11:57.660 --> 00:11:59.930
But a person called Lv Xiangchun

00:12:00.360 --> 00:12:04.000
Yes, it's me. Please wait a moment.

00:12:08.780 --> 00:12:09.350
Slow down.

00:12:10.580 --> 00:12:11.820
There might be a secret weapon in there.

00:12:12.690 --> 00:12:14.700
Don't make fun of me.

00:12:15.900 --> 00:12:19.140
You don't know that this green friend has 72 secret weapons.

00:12:19.180 --> 00:12:21.140
If he wants to hurt someone,

00:12:21.220 --> 00:12:23.320
why would he need to hide the secret weapon in the box?

00:12:25.360 --> 00:12:27.040
It's not a coincidence that Chief Wan has this status today.

00:12:30.830 --> 00:12:31.410
The same goes for Sun Yubo.

00:12:32.210 --> 00:12:34.670
With a good helper like you,

00:12:34.670 --> 00:12:36.720
it will be easy for him to succeed.

00:12:36.900 --> 00:12:39.430
This is a token of respect for Master.

00:12:40.290 --> 00:12:41.960
What does Sun Yubo want?

00:12:42.360 --> 00:12:44.760
He wants to use the top of the Shang Dynasty

00:12:45.100 --> 00:12:47.060
and the Lan Ting Iron of the Jin Dynasty

00:12:47.370 --> 00:12:49.670
to exchange for the Guanxi Sanhu of Master.

00:12:49.670 --> 00:12:53.440
He wants people.

00:12:54.980 --> 00:12:58.100
Okay, come with me.

00:13:12.220 --> 00:13:14.890
My treasure tower is usually not allowed to enter.

00:13:15.650 --> 00:13:16.090
Come.

00:13:16.600 --> 00:13:18.490
Let me introduce you.

00:13:18.990 --> 00:13:20.200
This is the Master Lv of the Dragon Sect.

00:13:21.280 --> 00:13:22.690
Master Lv.

00:13:22.710 --> 00:13:24.710
This is the last generation of the Nangong family.

00:13:25.630 --> 00:13:28.650
He is also one of the four most important young men in the world.

00:13:28.670 --> 00:13:29.980
Nangong...

00:13:30.950 --> 00:13:33.330
Long time no see.

00:13:33.430 --> 00:13:36.580
The world is full of your glorious past.

00:13:38.930 --> 00:13:41.760
Only the past is hard to buy in life.

00:13:42.620 --> 00:13:43.840
Life is like a dream.

00:13:43.920 --> 00:13:49.170
I am now one of the ten guests in Wanpeng Castle.

00:13:50.310 --> 00:13:52.890
But he knows a lot of things.

00:13:52.890 --> 00:13:54.370
So I give him all the antiques.

00:13:56.390 --> 00:13:57.150
Come on.

00:14:15.100 --> 00:14:16.480
This is what I usually collect.

00:14:17.900 --> 00:14:19.260
Which one do you like?

00:14:23.220 --> 00:14:28.310
This is the portrait of Dibos in the Shang Dynasty.

00:14:30.570 --> 00:14:33.030
Oh, and the He Shi Bi from the State of War.

00:14:33.030 --> 00:14:38.300
Oh, the horse from the Tang Dynasty.

00:14:38.700 --> 00:14:45.390
The things you have here are almost all real.

00:14:45.750 --> 00:14:46.680
Ha, ha, ha.

00:14:46.780 --> 00:14:51.010
All right, then choose two pieces and bring them back to Master.

00:14:51.310 --> 00:14:52.550
Even if it's my gift.

00:14:52.950 --> 00:14:56.280
Heh, Chief Wan, you must have heard wrong.

00:14:56.500 --> 00:14:59.380
What Master wants is not antiques, but people.

00:15:02.360 --> 00:15:05.060
And what the old man said he wanted, he must get it

00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:32.340
They are all here, just take them

00:15:32.340 --> 00:15:46.900
Just come to Wanpeng to get people, isn't that too much?

00:16:02.810 --> 00:16:04.630
I'm here for Guan Xi San Hu.

00:16:04.950 --> 00:16:08.330
If you don't want to interfere, you'd better stay out of it.

00:16:12.170 --> 00:16:13.840
Guan Xi San Hu is here.

00:16:14.350 --> 00:16:15.110
Come and report to me.

00:16:15.310 --> 00:16:18.310
Then we'll know which bastard died here today.

00:16:19.330 --> 00:16:22.220
Then you don't need to know my name.

00:16:23.100 --> 00:16:24.500
Because I'm not the one who died here today.

00:16:33.030 --> 00:16:40.840
I think if you want to kill someone here, you should at least ask me.

00:16:41.530 --> 00:16:43.880
People who want to kill their wives are people that should be killed,

00:16:44.160 --> 00:16:46.300
so no one has to ask.

00:16:47.150 --> 00:16:59.970
If you really want to kill someone here,

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:03.830
If you don't kill the three of them, you can leave here and not kill him.

00:17:07.840 --> 00:17:09.840
If you think you can stop me like this,

00:17:09.920 --> 00:17:11.400
please take a look at the back.

00:17:13.300 --> 00:17:14.820
What are you doing?

00:17:15.000 --> 00:17:16.290
Can't you hear me?

00:17:17.030 --> 00:17:19.210
Brother Lv said that Master Yubo wants to take a few people.

00:17:19.830 --> 00:17:22.180
So you are Master Yubo's spy.

00:17:22.500 --> 00:17:25.950
But you have been here for ten years.

00:17:27.330 --> 00:17:29.860
But for the past ten years, I have been...

00:17:30.000 --> 00:17:35.400
with the help of Master Yubo.

00:17:39.510 --> 00:17:43.270
One, two, three.

00:17:45.460 --> 00:17:49.010
Mr. Nangong, I'm done here.

00:17:49.010 --> 00:17:49.880
I'm leaving.

00:17:50.120 --> 00:17:50.460
Please.

00:17:51.250 --> 00:17:53.570
Go back and say hello to Master Yubo for me.

00:17:53.570 --> 00:17:54.190
I will.

00:17:54.410 --> 00:17:56.470
Thank you.

00:17:56.890 --> 00:17:57.170
Please.

00:18:01.050 --> 00:18:09.220
Have you ever thought about how you will leave after he leaves?

00:18:09.220 --> 00:18:14.700
People who work with Lao Bo have never thought about themselves.

00:18:48.010 --> 00:18:59.980
Spring comes and winter comes, spring comes and winter comes

00:19:00.000 --> 00:19:01.830
If you are drunk, you will make people drink.

00:19:02.110 --> 00:19:07.110
If you are a bug, you will make people hate you.

00:19:07.110 --> 00:19:08.970
If you are a water, you will make water move.

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:31.760
Who are you?

00:19:31.780 --> 00:19:33.430
I'm a lost man

00:19:33.430 --> 00:19:35.520
Luckily I was lost

00:19:35.520 --> 00:19:37.700
That's why I heard such touching words

00:19:37.700 --> 00:19:47.460
Do you understand words?

00:19:47.720 --> 00:19:50.810
No, I just like words

00:19:50.810 --> 00:19:55.230
Do you understand butterflies?

00:19:56.830 --> 00:19:58.720
No, I just like butterflies

00:20:00.990 --> 00:20:05.990
Butterflies live in spring, and when spring comes, their beauty disappears.

00:20:06.540 --> 00:20:12.660
That's why some people say that butterflies are like love, they are beautiful, they are short-lived.

00:20:12.740 --> 00:20:19.990
When they arrive, you don't catch them, and when spring comes, you want to catch them, but you can't.

00:20:20.390 --> 00:20:25.110
Okay, we've talked too much. Goodbye.

00:20:25.920 --> 00:20:29.930
Miss, my surname is Meng.

00:20:30.060 --> 00:20:34.890
Don't say it. I don't want to know your name

00:20:34.890 --> 00:20:37.570
Because we are not friends at all

00:20:37.570 --> 00:20:41.740
We were not friends in the past, and I'm afraid we won't be friends in the future

00:20:43.840 --> 00:20:44.020
Why?

00:20:44.400 --> 00:20:50.380
Just where you stand now

00:20:50.380 --> 00:20:54.330
There were many people who wanted to be friends with me

00:21:00.000 --> 00:21:00.500
Are you afraid of death?

00:21:01.070 --> 00:21:04.170
No, I'm not afraid of death

00:21:04.170 --> 00:21:08.300
Because death will always stand in front of me

00:21:08.300 --> 00:21:11.000
What's your name?

00:21:11.300 --> 00:21:12.280
Meng Xinghun

00:21:12.280 --> 00:21:13.630
Nice name

00:21:13.630 --> 00:21:19.440
If you turn around and walk towards the star of Beidou

00:21:19.440 --> 00:21:21.460
You'll find your way to the mainland

00:21:21.460 --> 00:21:23.120
Thank you

00:21:23.120 --> 00:21:27.010
This butterfly

00:21:27.010 --> 00:21:29.040
You keep it

00:21:30.000 --> 00:21:32.880
Otherwise, the spring will pass and I won't be able to catch any more.

00:21:32.940 --> 00:21:39.020
That's good. Let her remind me that I have been to such a beautiful place.

00:21:39.240 --> 00:21:49.330
Butterflies are so beautiful.

00:21:52.400 --> 00:21:52.740
Ye Xiang.

00:21:52.900 --> 00:21:55.130
Where did you catch them?

00:21:56.760 --> 00:21:57.440
In the butterfly forest.

00:22:00.830 --> 00:22:01.650
Have you ever been to Hu Jilin?

00:22:01.710 --> 00:22:02.010
No.

00:22:02.900 --> 00:22:06.980
Then drink less.

00:22:07.140 --> 00:22:15.650
I can't hold a sword anymore.

00:22:19.150 --> 00:22:22.530
After a killer fails once,

00:22:23.070 --> 00:22:26.780
he doesn't even believe in himself.

00:22:27.520 --> 00:22:28.380
Boss said that

00:22:29.260 --> 00:22:29.740
your sword

00:22:30.000 --> 00:22:31.870
Is it because you love a girl?

00:22:32.490 --> 00:22:36.570
No, it's because I like a girl

00:22:36.570 --> 00:22:39.880
Later, I almost got killed for her

00:22:40.840 --> 00:22:43.640
From childhood, we adopted Boss Gao

00:22:43.640 --> 00:22:49.370
Growing up together, we are like brothers

00:22:49.370 --> 00:22:55.280
We can do anything

00:23:00.000 --> 00:23:02.650
You can't have life and family.

00:23:05.710 --> 00:23:06.970
You can't like these two words.

00:23:07.070 --> 00:23:22.220
You can't have the joy of failure.

00:23:22.240 --> 00:23:25.630
At least you can't enjoy it

00:23:25.630 --> 00:23:25.810
if you succeed.

00:23:35.080 --> 00:23:36.720
Boss Ba will take you there.

00:24:05.020 --> 00:24:10.670
Boss, what can I do for you?

00:24:10.690 --> 00:24:12.920
I've seen Master Yubo. How is he?

00:24:13.100 --> 00:24:14.810
It's not easy to kill him.

00:24:15.260 --> 00:24:18.480
Master Yubo knows it's not easy to kill him.

00:24:18.480 --> 00:24:21.000
But for the 100,000 taels of gold,

00:24:21.280 --> 00:24:22.890
we must be able to kill him.

00:24:23.540 --> 00:24:25.360
And we must kill him before Lord Wanpeng.

00:24:26.260 --> 00:24:27.570
Lord Wanpeng?

00:24:28.040 --> 00:24:29.820
Master Yubo...

00:24:30.000 --> 00:24:30.580
It was done by the Flying Rocs Gang

00:24:31.840 --> 00:24:34.240
And Lord Wanpeng has already done it

00:24:34.240 --> 00:24:43.420
It's these two

00:24:43.420 --> 00:24:46.610
Yes, these are the things the Flying Rocs Gang just sent

00:24:47.840 --> 00:24:53.420
Wait, tell them to open it

00:24:53.420 --> 00:24:53.600
Yes

00:25:10.010 --> 00:25:13.760
I've long thought that the Flying Rocs Gang was a bit of an accident.

00:25:13.760 --> 00:25:17.020
Where are you going?

00:25:17.040 --> 00:25:18.590
To the Bidong Fort.

00:25:18.790 --> 00:25:19.660
To die?

00:25:20.590 --> 00:25:26.240
If they want us to go, we won't go.

00:25:26.380 --> 00:25:29.370
They want us to be better than them.

00:25:30.000 --> 00:25:38.000
Xiangchuan, what do you think their next move will be?

00:25:39.130 --> 00:25:42.560
Their next move is to wait for our next move

00:25:43.220 --> 00:25:48.100
Then we will bury Zhang Laofu

00:25:48.100 --> 00:25:51.880
Song Jian, when the time comes, you will be in charge of the funeral

00:25:51.880 --> 00:25:58.360
Today, Tai Guancai's, Guafeng's, Chui Gu's and Daoshi's

00:25:58.360 --> 00:25:59.830
will all be replaced by our people

00:26:01.500 --> 00:26:05.080
We have to find a place where they can easily be ambushed.

00:26:05.140 --> 00:26:06.810
What if they don't come?

00:26:07.850 --> 00:26:10.190
As long as you are here, they will definitely come.

00:26:33.290 --> 00:26:33.310
Let's go!

00:26:37.710 --> 00:26:38.430
Listen up!

00:26:39.290 --> 00:26:40.770
We're here to kill Sun Jian!

00:26:40.950 --> 00:26:42.510
Those who don't deserve to live, leave!

00:26:42.990 --> 00:26:48.180
12th Flying Rocs Gang is really here!

00:26:48.820 --> 00:26:50.600
We're here to kill you!

00:26:50.740 --> 00:26:51.780
You're wrong!

00:26:52.040 --> 00:26:53.520
You're here to die!

00:26:53.800 --> 00:26:54.160
Kill them!

00:27:34.440 --> 00:27:37.450
Sun Jian, Brother Lv has arranged it well this time.

00:27:37.570 --> 00:27:39.520
We finally avenged the old man and his wife.

00:27:40.930 --> 00:27:42.470
If Wan Peng Wang finds out about today's incident,

00:27:42.510 --> 00:27:43.550
he will be so angry that he will kill himself.

00:27:44.690 --> 00:27:55.660
Sun Jian! Sun Jian!

00:28:01.610 --> 00:28:02.570
Young Master, Young Master

00:28:02.570 --> 00:28:05.800
Young Master

00:28:30.280 --> 00:28:35.660
Who chose the coffin?

00:28:40.220 --> 00:28:42.520
It's me.

00:28:42.580 --> 00:28:46.410
Because the three generations of them are all from our Longmen Fortress.

00:28:47.560 --> 00:28:49.080
And they have always been loyal to us.

00:28:57.580 --> 00:28:59.900
There really isn't a single thing that can be used as a weapon.

00:29:00.000 --> 00:29:00.900
I don't want to see it.

00:29:01.860 --> 00:29:02.340
God!

00:29:15.000 --> 00:29:15.080
Thank you.

00:30:00.850 --> 00:30:17.050
Feng Hao is here, you go find Han Tang for me right now

00:30:17.050 --> 00:30:17.210
Yes

00:30:17.420 --> 00:30:21.690
Where are you going?

00:30:23.300 --> 00:30:23.860
I'm going to find Han Tang

00:30:23.860 --> 00:30:25.310
Do you know where Han Tang lives?

00:30:26.420 --> 00:30:29.450
I don't know

00:30:34.030 --> 00:30:34.770
This is the address of Han Tang.

00:30:36.400 --> 00:30:37.640
Don't show it to anyone.

00:30:38.900 --> 00:30:40.900
Because the place where Han Tang lives is very secretive.

00:30:41.820 --> 00:30:42.900
And who knows that

00:30:42.900 --> 00:30:46.920
if you want to kill an old man, you should kill Han Tang first.

00:31:02.910 --> 00:31:03.070
Help!

00:31:05.600 --> 00:31:06.000
Help!

00:31:07.800 --> 00:31:08.200
Help!

00:31:10.370 --> 00:31:12.250
Brother, help!

00:31:13.540 --> 00:31:17.510
Brother, we are the men of Lao Bo.

00:31:17.550 --> 00:31:18.570
We have settled the score.

00:31:18.670 --> 00:31:20.410
Thank you for giving us a place to hide.

00:31:21.620 --> 00:31:22.680
Brother, please.

00:31:27.150 --> 00:31:27.550
Brother.

00:31:27.770 --> 00:31:29.970
I've told you a long time ago.

00:31:30.000 --> 00:31:31.720
No matter where you go, it's useless.

00:31:32.040 --> 00:31:33.060
Just come and die here.

00:31:33.780 --> 00:31:38.140
Little girl, do you really want them?

00:31:39.120 --> 00:31:40.020
Of course.

00:31:41.380 --> 00:31:41.920
Good.

00:32:01.690 --> 00:32:01.810
Oh!

00:32:30.120 --> 00:32:31.520
All of you are here to kill me.

00:32:34.750 --> 00:32:39.830
You must be wondering how we found you.

00:32:40.840 --> 00:32:42.260
Of course someone told us.

00:32:42.440 --> 00:32:45.560
It's a pity that you can never guess who this person is.

00:32:45.640 --> 00:32:49.300
Who are you?

00:32:49.380 --> 00:32:52.430
The top 4 guards of the 12th Flying Rocs Sect.

00:32:53.260 --> 00:32:55.730
Wanpeng wants to kill me.

00:32:57.120 --> 00:32:59.400
Everyone knows that to kill Lao Bo,

00:32:59.540 --> 00:32:59.980
you must first kill the old man.

00:33:00.000 --> 00:33:00.720
Kill Han Tang. Go!

00:33:30.120 --> 00:33:48.300
It's you!

00:33:50.010 --> 00:33:56.700
You don't need to help these farmers

00:34:03.420 --> 00:34:06.000
It's you who killed me

00:34:06.120 --> 00:34:13.640
The old man said that the sword in the hands of the enemy is not scary

00:34:13.640 --> 00:34:17.010
The most terrifying thing is the weapon in the hands of a friend

00:34:34.920 --> 00:34:40.240
He was already dead when I arrived

00:34:40.240 --> 00:34:42.610
Yes, he was already dead when I arrived

00:34:42.610 --> 00:34:45.680
Is there anyone else in this world?

00:34:47.190 --> 00:34:49.800
No, I will come to see you as soon as I come back

00:34:49.800 --> 00:34:59.000
No one can know

00:35:00.190 --> 00:35:00.550
I got it.

00:35:00.570 --> 00:35:01.670
Luo Ye.

00:35:10.340 --> 00:35:10.480
Yes.

00:35:10.640 --> 00:35:15.290
Luo Ye.

00:35:15.390 --> 00:35:22.500
I secretly met him.

00:35:22.740 --> 00:35:23.000
What happened in the gang?

00:35:23.880 --> 00:35:25.760
After meeting him,

00:35:31.050 --> 00:35:38.580
There is a spy in the gang.

00:35:38.580 --> 00:35:39.610
Oh, right.

00:35:39.950 --> 00:35:42.600
When I came here, I heard that Yi Qianlong betrayed us.

00:35:42.800 --> 00:35:44.370
Is there such a thing?

00:35:44.410 --> 00:35:44.710
Yes.

00:35:45.170 --> 00:35:47.990
He got the leader card back.

00:35:48.860 --> 00:35:50.430
He killed Han Tang?

00:35:50.710 --> 00:35:50.890
No.

00:35:53.000 --> 00:35:59.840
Only Lv Xiangchuan and I live here.

00:36:02.480 --> 00:36:03.240
Lv Xiangchuan?

00:36:03.360 --> 00:36:10.940
My godson-in-law

00:36:11.260 --> 00:36:20.040
Now I can't help but suspect

00:36:20.040 --> 00:36:23.880
Because there are many things other than him

00:36:23.880 --> 00:36:27.060
The patient has no way to do it

00:36:27.060 --> 00:36:29.510
Then why don't you do it?

00:36:30.800 --> 00:36:32.460
Because I like him very much

00:36:32.460 --> 00:36:35.250
I hope it's not him

00:36:35.250 --> 00:36:39.960
So I want to try again

00:36:39.960 --> 00:36:41.600
You want to try again?

00:36:41.950 --> 00:36:45.860
If it's not the traitor

00:36:45.860 --> 00:36:48.330
Then he doesn't know about Han Tang

00:36:48.330 --> 00:36:52.030
I also know that there are many masters in the Flying Rocs Gang

00:36:52.570 --> 00:36:55.080
Now they are gathering in the Hangzhou Dafang Inn

00:36:55.080 --> 00:36:59.210
Oh, you want to ask Xiang Chuan to go there to find Han Tang?

00:36:59.350 --> 00:36:59.570
Yes

00:37:00.800 --> 00:37:03.670
We followed him to Dafang Inn

00:37:03.670 --> 00:37:05.720
and found out everything

00:37:05.720 --> 00:37:05.960
Yes

00:37:07.070 --> 00:37:21.780
You just came back from the night

00:37:21.780 --> 00:37:22.820
Where are you going now?

00:37:22.820 --> 00:37:24.340
I have something urgent to do

00:37:24.340 --> 00:37:25.210
I'm going to Hangzhou

00:37:31.280 --> 00:37:31.580
End of Episode Two

00:38:05.400 --> 00:38:11.280
Sir, please come in, please have a seat

00:38:11.870 --> 00:38:14.920
Sir, what would you like to eat?

00:38:15.100 --> 00:38:16.150
I would like to have some leeks

00:38:16.150 --> 00:38:17.250
Ok, ok, ok

00:38:17.250 --> 00:38:23.760
I have an appointment with a very important person

00:38:23.760 --> 00:38:25.050
He is having a secret meeting at Dafang Inn

00:38:25.050 --> 00:38:28.400
You go there and try to kill him

00:38:33.770 --> 00:38:35.340
Sir, the leeks are here.

00:38:40.460 --> 00:38:42.640
Manager, is there anyone living upstairs?

00:38:42.760 --> 00:38:43.760
No, they're all dead.

00:38:44.000 --> 00:38:44.240
Why?

00:38:44.880 --> 00:38:48.420
Because the 12 Flying Rocs Gang never leave a place to live.

00:38:49.480 --> 00:38:57.280
Flying Rocs Gang.

00:38:58.200 --> 00:38:59.200
Five poisons in one hand.

00:39:00.120 --> 00:39:01.400
Shi Erfeipengbang's accomplice

00:39:01.400 --> 00:39:10.450
He colluded with Shi Erfeipengbang

00:39:11.590 --> 00:39:16.360
No, because I am not Han Tang

00:39:16.360 --> 00:39:19.120
Han Tang has already killed us

00:39:19.120 --> 00:39:23.100
Just because we know that Han Tang is dead

00:39:23.100 --> 00:39:25.400
Lao Bo has already suspected you

00:39:25.400 --> 00:39:27.880
As expected, now that Lao Bo is in trouble

00:39:27.880 --> 00:39:28.920
You have also been betrayed

00:39:30.350 --> 00:39:33.820
Looks like Longmen Gang's skills are about the same

00:39:35.040 --> 00:39:35.380
Go!

00:40:05.440 --> 00:40:09.350
Lv Xiangchuan, I didn't expect you to be buried in Dafang Inn.

00:40:53.360 --> 00:40:56.820
Uncle, I'm glad you arrived in time, or else my dad would have died here.

00:40:57.930 --> 00:40:59.250
They say Han Tang is dead.

00:41:00.160 --> 00:41:05.510
We knew it. We suspected you because he was dead.

00:41:05.880 --> 00:41:08.180
Otherwise, you would never have fallen into the trap.

00:41:10.140 --> 00:41:12.270
We thought Feng Hao was missing.

00:41:12.270 --> 00:41:17.390
He wouldn't. If he betrayed Han Tang, would he dare go back?

00:41:18.190 --> 00:41:19.880
Besides, he doesn't have the guts.

00:41:21.020 --> 00:41:23.400
They said I was betrayed.

00:41:23.560 --> 00:41:27.290
That means there is a spy in our gang.

00:41:28.180 --> 00:41:29.300
I know that.

00:41:30.990 --> 00:41:34.550
And I believe that spy will be exposed soon.

00:41:34.550 --> 00:41:37.590
You want to see me?

00:41:38.550 --> 00:41:41.470
Because now we have a very good opportunity.

00:41:42.900 --> 00:41:47.240
First, Lao Bo and the Flying Rocs Gang have almost been defeated.

00:41:47.720 --> 00:41:51.210
Second, in order to fight with Lord Wanpeng,

00:41:52.110 --> 00:41:53.660
Lao Bo is recruiting soldiers.

00:41:54.000 --> 00:41:56.280
People like you who rely on him,

00:41:56.300 --> 00:41:57.920
he will definitely use you.

00:41:58.000 --> 00:41:59.970
But...

00:42:00.000 --> 00:42:01.400
They will definitely investigate me

00:42:01.400 --> 00:42:04.450
I have already arranged it for you

00:42:04.450 --> 00:42:07.460
Your surname is Qin, your name is Qin Zhongting

00:42:07.460 --> 00:42:08.500
You are from the South China Sea

00:42:08.500 --> 00:42:11.620
The details of the situation are here

00:42:11.620 --> 00:42:17.600
Besides, we have already arranged our own people

00:42:17.600 --> 00:42:20.180
As soon as you get there, he will contact you

00:42:20.180 --> 00:42:25.920
Do you have any questions to ask me?

00:42:26.100 --> 00:42:26.380
No

00:42:26.980 --> 00:42:29.440
Then I should ask you, when did you move in?

00:42:32.170 --> 00:42:59.520
Now, I'm leaving with Beidouxin

00:43:00.000 --> 00:43:00.540
Why?

00:43:01.620 --> 00:43:03.440
I'm here to find the butterfly while the spring is still here.

00:43:04.960 --> 00:43:08.410
Do you know that many people will die at your feet?

00:43:08.810 --> 00:43:17.900
You told me that, but no matter where people stand, they will die.

00:43:20.420 --> 00:43:28.160
You have a lot of courage. It's time to eat.

00:43:28.740 --> 00:43:29.960
If you can't eat, I can't eat.

00:43:30.000 --> 00:43:32.020
Why don't you come in and have a drink?

00:43:32.280 --> 00:43:35.530
It's convenient.

00:43:35.790 --> 00:43:39.640
There are many poems written by Li Bai,

00:43:40.160 --> 00:43:42.020
but they are not as well-written as the other poems.

00:43:42.180 --> 00:43:44.690
But if you are not a friend,

00:43:44.930 --> 00:43:46.550
even if there are thousands of soldiers,

00:43:46.910 --> 00:43:49.050
it is difficult to enter this small building.

00:43:49.610 --> 00:43:51.630
Thank you.

00:43:51.750 --> 00:43:51.990
Please.

00:43:54.540 --> 00:43:54.700
Please.

00:44:03.230 --> 00:44:09.250
Jinxiao, Jiuxinghe, Yangliu'an, Xiaofeng, and Canyue

00:44:09.250 --> 00:44:11.830
The people are scattered, but I am in a hurry

00:44:11.830 --> 00:44:19.600
It's better to live with someone else

00:44:22.080 --> 00:44:28.170
Yes, I don't know where I will be next year

00:44:33.040 --> 00:44:33.960
You are from the martial arts world

00:44:33.960 --> 00:44:39.330
You should have seen it

00:44:39.330 --> 00:44:41.240
It's a life saver

00:44:41.240 --> 00:44:44.100
No wonder you don't care about life

00:44:45.060 --> 00:44:49.990
I had a friend who was a life saver

00:44:49.990 --> 00:44:52.370
He also liked lions

00:44:52.370 --> 00:44:56.640
Later, my father found out

00:44:56.640 --> 00:44:58.700
He sent someone to kill him

00:45:00.090 --> 00:45:04.920
I fought with my father for this and moved out.

00:45:05.000 --> 00:45:06.500
Who is your father?

00:45:06.860 --> 00:45:10.220
You don't need to know.

00:45:11.270 --> 00:45:13.720
He doesn't regard me as his daughter.

00:45:18.840 --> 00:45:21.840
Why did you come to see me today?

00:45:22.440 --> 00:45:24.320
I want to kill someone and pass through here.

00:45:24.440 --> 00:45:28.940
Kill? You're not afraid of death?

00:45:30.060 --> 00:45:35.740
I'm used to it, but now I hope I can live on.

00:45:36.580 --> 00:45:37.020
Why?

00:45:40.260 --> 00:45:42.060
Because I like the butterflies here.

00:45:42.120 --> 00:45:47.500
Once there was a killer who said that

00:45:48.300 --> 00:45:52.660
there should be no love in this industry.

00:45:54.380 --> 00:45:56.950
Because every morning I go out,

00:45:56.990 --> 00:45:59.460
I don't know if I can live at night.

00:46:07.200 --> 00:46:18.800
It's getting late. I should go. Thank you for your hospitality, Miss.

00:46:20.650 --> 00:46:26.650
Mr. Meng, the spring here is very long.

00:46:26.810 --> 00:46:29.120
If you come back and pass through here,

00:46:30.090 --> 00:46:30.770
Let's catch some more butterflies.

00:46:31.390 --> 00:46:33.010
I really hope I can come back to see you again.

00:46:34.430 --> 00:46:37.040
But if spring is over,

00:46:37.200 --> 00:46:39.230
then there's no need to wait any longer.

00:46:44.090 --> 00:46:49.950
Miss Da Jiao, one night,

00:46:50.150 --> 00:46:52.440
I haven't asked Miss Fang Ming...

00:46:55.820 --> 00:46:56.160
Xiaodie.

00:47:01.400 --> 00:47:02.860
Why did you come to me?

00:47:03.040 --> 00:47:03.980
I'm not sure who I'm coming to.

00:47:05.420 --> 00:47:08.630
I'm just here to see who is my friend.

00:47:09.190 --> 00:47:12.430
Is it you, or King Wanpeng?

00:47:12.690 --> 00:47:15.990
Xiangchuan, have you seen him?

00:47:16.290 --> 00:47:17.340
He came when he was celebrating his birthday.

00:47:17.880 --> 00:47:19.690
What's his name?

00:47:20.070 --> 00:47:22.820
I forgot.

00:47:24.060 --> 00:47:26.830
What? You'll forget too?

00:47:27.580 --> 00:47:29.400
At that time, he wasn't here to make friends.

00:47:30.090 --> 00:47:31.190
Of course, it's not a real name.

00:47:31.290 --> 00:47:34.430
Since it's not a real name, why should I remember it?

00:47:34.930 --> 00:47:41.990
You're good.

00:47:42.690 --> 00:47:43.630
You're not bad.

00:47:47.940 --> 00:47:49.000
What's your name?

00:47:49.360 --> 00:47:51.030
The name may be fake.

00:47:51.190 --> 00:47:52.800
But friends don't know how to say it.

00:47:53.680 --> 00:47:55.220
Since I'm here to make friends with you,

00:47:55.970 --> 00:47:56.850
why should I ask for a name?

00:48:01.760 --> 00:48:03.880
Then what should we call you in the future?

00:48:04.000 --> 00:48:05.440
His name is Qin Zhong Ting.

00:48:05.540 --> 00:48:06.780
Qin Zhong Ting?

00:48:07.020 --> 00:48:11.380
Then who is the master of the largest family in Nanhai, Qin Hu Hua?

00:48:12.160 --> 00:48:13.240
He is my uncle.

00:48:14.010 --> 00:48:15.630
Have you seen him recently?

00:48:15.650 --> 00:48:16.420
Yes, I have.

00:48:17.120 --> 00:48:18.060
Is his asthma better?

00:48:18.560 --> 00:48:21.650
He doesn't have any asthma at all.

00:48:22.090 --> 00:48:22.410
Oh?

00:48:30.160 --> 00:48:32.900
Xiangchuan, prepare some rooms for her.

00:48:32.900 --> 00:48:34.560
Yes, wife.

00:49:00.500 --> 00:49:02.020
I've already arranged for my own people inside Xiaobo.

00:49:02.040 --> 00:49:04.640
As soon as you get there, I'll naturally contact you.

00:49:07.400 --> 00:49:22.430
Meng Qinghuan, close the door and blow it out.

00:49:39.240 --> 00:49:40.760
Why did you come here now?

00:49:41.400 --> 00:49:43.840
You should have been here half a month ago.

00:49:43.840 --> 00:49:45.040
Lu Man Tian?

00:49:45.660 --> 00:49:47.640
If it wasn't for me,

00:49:47.840 --> 00:49:50.240
would you be able to answer today's question?

00:49:50.440 --> 00:49:54.450
Lao Bo's best friend betrayed Lao Bo.

00:49:56.220 --> 00:49:57.720
If a person wants to climb high,

00:49:58.270 --> 00:49:59.690
sometimes he has to...

00:50:00.000 --> 00:50:01.020
You can't step on someone else's head.

00:50:01.360 --> 00:50:05.620
When are you going to do it?

00:50:05.700 --> 00:50:07.610
When the opportunity comes.

00:50:08.650 --> 00:50:10.750
I never give anyone a chance.

00:50:10.890 --> 00:50:12.630
So you don't have to wait.

00:50:12.710 --> 00:50:15.190
Then when do you want me to do it?

00:50:15.580 --> 00:50:15.880
Tomorrow.

00:50:16.830 --> 00:50:17.210
Tomorrow?

00:50:17.830 --> 00:50:19.270
Yes, tomorrow at dusk.

00:50:19.290 --> 00:50:22.520
I live alone in an independent garden.

00:50:23.400 --> 00:50:24.780
Because at dusk,

00:50:24.980 --> 00:50:27.790
which is the quietest time in Dragon Gate Castle,

00:50:28.480 --> 00:50:29.660
everyone works for a day.

00:50:30.250 --> 00:50:31.950
He took a bath and took a rest

00:50:31.950 --> 00:50:35.620
At this time, he was not allowed to go into the garden

00:50:35.620 --> 00:50:40.140
Because he had to sleep for half an hour before eating

00:50:40.140 --> 00:50:41.360
Only when he was sleeping

00:50:41.360 --> 00:50:43.740
He took off the unbreakable sand

00:50:43.740 --> 00:50:46.060
Only at this time

00:50:46.060 --> 00:50:48.060
Can the sword pierce through his heart

00:50:48.060 --> 00:50:50.200
You said you were not allowed to go in

00:50:50.200 --> 00:50:51.870
Then how can I go in?

00:50:52.620 --> 00:50:54.540
I have already made a tunnel for you

00:50:54.540 --> 00:50:56.660
Just under the flower

00:50:56.660 --> 00:50:59.700
Is there any hidden card in the garden?

00:51:00.760 --> 00:51:02.320
Yes, but I can't tell him

00:51:02.320 --> 00:51:04.190
How many chances do you have of success?

00:51:04.210 --> 00:51:05.600
At least 70%

00:51:05.600 --> 00:51:06.280
That's enough

00:51:07.010 --> 00:51:10.490
Usually I can handle 50%

00:51:10.490 --> 00:51:14.620
I'll wait for your good news tomorrow at dusk

00:51:14.620 --> 00:51:24.330
Your Majesty, you go kill Master Yubo for me right away

00:51:24.330 --> 00:51:24.410
Why?

00:51:25.580 --> 00:51:27.550
Because I know that before Meng Xinhun went to Longmen Castle

00:51:27.550 --> 00:51:28.730
he went to the Butterfly Forest

00:51:30.320 --> 00:51:31.320
Do you know who lives in Butterfly Forest?

00:51:31.920 --> 00:51:44.150
My daughter, Xiaodie

00:51:44.150 --> 00:51:47.740
If Meng Xinghun likes Xiaodie, what will he do?

00:51:50.100 --> 00:51:50.380
Kill her

00:51:52.100 --> 00:51:53.320
But we accepted a deal

00:51:53.320 --> 00:51:54.560
We want Lao Bo to die

00:52:00.220 --> 00:52:07.360
I've already told him that we shouldn't like these two words.

00:52:07.860 --> 00:52:13.880
Ye Xiang, you should have killed Master Yubo a long time ago.

00:52:13.880 --> 00:52:16.480
I know that three years ago, you went to the butterfly forest.

00:52:16.600 --> 00:52:19.770
For Qin Ying, for the poems you like,

00:52:19.770 --> 00:52:22.290
you fell in love with a very beautiful girl.

00:52:22.650 --> 00:52:24.050
Her name is Xiaobie.

00:52:24.190 --> 00:52:25.570
She is the only daughter of Sun Yubo.

00:52:26.250 --> 00:52:29.520
And I heard that the girl likes you very much.

00:52:30.760 --> 00:52:34.000
But later, the old man found out about this matter, and he was very angry

00:52:34.000 --> 00:52:36.930
Because he couldn't let his daughter fall in love with a killer

00:52:36.930 --> 00:52:39.320
So he asked Han Tang to kill her

00:52:39.320 --> 00:52:42.630
The two of them fought beside Taihu for three days and three nights

00:52:42.630 --> 00:52:44.930
Finally, you defeated Han Tang

00:52:44.930 --> 00:52:48.450
And Han Tang was so happy that he didn't kill you

00:52:48.450 --> 00:52:51.440
You've been drinking and drooling all the time

00:52:52.200 --> 00:52:53.480
You look like a half-man, half-ghost

00:52:53.940 --> 00:52:56.120
Think about it, did you kill the old man?

00:52:56.920 --> 00:52:58.040
Did you kill the old man?

00:53:02.130 --> 00:53:11.090
You want to kill your wife?

00:53:11.230 --> 00:53:14.780
Besides, I can't kill Xiaodie's father

00:53:14.780 --> 00:53:19.670
Xiaodie, you have me here

00:53:19.670 --> 00:53:21.640
I can satisfy men more than anyone

00:53:21.640 --> 00:53:23.240
Come on, let's go

00:53:23.240 --> 00:53:24.880
I want you to know

00:53:24.880 --> 00:53:26.200
I am a real woman

00:53:26.200 --> 00:53:27.260
What are you doing?

00:53:27.320 --> 00:53:28.320
I want you to know that no one can compare to me

00:53:28.320 --> 00:53:28.600
What are you doing?

00:53:31.280 --> 00:53:32.420
What? You can't?

00:53:32.600 --> 00:53:36.020
I thought you can't kill, but you can't even do this?

00:53:36.360 --> 00:53:37.740
Don't come over here.

00:53:38.260 --> 00:53:41.170
Stop pretending, or you'll have to do it yourself.

00:53:41.290 --> 00:53:43.530
Come on, take a good look.

00:53:43.710 --> 00:53:45.330
This is much better than you doing it yourself.

00:53:47.790 --> 00:53:48.480
Go to hell!

00:53:48.800 --> 00:53:49.600
You stupid woman!

00:53:49.840 --> 00:53:51.170
Get out of here!

00:53:52.560 --> 00:53:54.670
Ye Xiang, how about this?

00:53:55.160 --> 00:53:55.880
Tomorrow before the wedding,

00:53:56.940 --> 00:53:59.730
I want my wife to die, or you won't be able to live.

00:54:00.280 --> 00:54:03.220
Get out of my way!

00:54:03.240 --> 00:54:05.360
Go away!

00:54:09.960 --> 00:54:11.020
Tomorrow at dusk

00:55:00.000 --> 00:55:00.320
This is my room.

00:55:00.540 --> 00:55:04.580
There are some flowers here.

00:55:04.580 --> 00:55:05.940
It's very shallow.

00:55:07.320 --> 00:55:09.520
You look very beautiful today.

00:55:12.800 --> 00:55:13.700
I'm here to see the flowers.

00:55:13.880 --> 00:55:16.310
That's why I'm very special today.

00:55:16.330 --> 00:55:17.470
I don't have time to sleep.

00:55:17.530 --> 00:55:23.960
Why did you come to see me?

00:55:24.760 --> 00:55:25.060
Nothing.

00:55:27.260 --> 00:55:29.840
I was just wandering around.

00:55:30.000 --> 00:55:32.860
So I came all the way here.

00:55:34.760 --> 00:55:40.930
I didn't tell you that you can't go anywhere in the Dragon Castle.

00:55:41.410 --> 00:55:42.680
You can't enter this garden.

00:55:44.570 --> 00:55:47.250
Because I'm used to sleep at this time.

00:55:47.610 --> 00:55:50.600
If I fall asleep like I usually do today,

00:55:50.600 --> 00:55:52.750
and you come to torture me,

00:55:53.420 --> 00:55:54.580
you'll get your revenge.

00:55:55.620 --> 00:55:59.360
Lang Zhong.

00:56:01.950 --> 00:56:13.060
Guards, this is my special case card.

00:56:16.400 --> 00:56:18.900
Go and tell Master Lv to call in the people outside the door.

00:56:19.760 --> 00:56:20.240
Yes.

00:56:20.640 --> 00:56:28.100
Is Yao Ling your friend?

00:56:30.670 --> 00:56:32.090
Only the doctor who sells the medicine will be able to get in

00:56:32.090 --> 00:56:36.700
There is no one around here

00:56:36.700 --> 00:56:39.660
Ordinary doctors wouldn't be able to get in here

00:56:39.660 --> 00:56:42.610
And from the sound of his voice

00:56:42.610 --> 00:56:47.760
It seems as if someone is trying to kill me

00:56:47.760 --> 00:56:52.720
If you don't believe me, follow me

00:57:03.640 --> 00:57:04.990
Uncle, the doctor is here.

00:57:05.320 --> 00:57:07.400
He came just in time.

00:57:08.130 --> 00:57:10.120
We are looking for a doctor.

00:57:10.520 --> 00:57:17.270
Is there a patient here?

00:57:17.450 --> 00:57:17.850
No.

00:57:20.100 --> 00:57:25.370
That's good, because I don't know how to treat patients.

00:57:26.990 --> 00:57:28.840
Then, what do you know?

00:57:30.480 --> 00:57:31.540
Lao Bo knows how to kill people.

00:57:36.030 --> 00:57:37.490
Then who are you going to kill?

00:57:37.850 --> 00:57:39.520
Of course, I'm going to kill you.

00:57:39.760 --> 00:57:40.000
Why?

00:57:42.440 --> 00:57:45.660
Because I heard that no one has ever been able to kill you.

00:57:45.860 --> 00:57:57.110
Have you heard that Lao Bo has a sword that is as sharp as a knife?

00:58:01.280 --> 00:58:05.300
Now that I've seen you, I can't believe I can't even kill you.

00:58:15.300 --> 00:58:18.150
You're trying every way you can. What is it for?

00:58:18.430 --> 00:58:19.390
Cut the crap.

00:58:32.810 --> 00:58:33.250
Who are you?

00:58:33.270 --> 00:58:34.570
Do you still remember

00:58:34.570 --> 00:58:36.290
for your daughter

00:58:36.290 --> 00:58:36.890
you once

00:58:36.890 --> 00:58:39.640
went to Han Tang to kill

00:58:39.640 --> 00:58:40.950
a killer named Ye Xiang?

00:58:41.530 --> 00:58:41.750
Yes

00:58:45.620 --> 00:58:49.070
He didn't die

00:58:49.070 --> 00:58:53.700
Although I didn't kill him

00:58:55.780 --> 00:58:56.660
from that day on

00:58:56.660 --> 00:58:59.260
I was about to die

00:59:00.960 --> 00:59:13.650
I sent you to kill me just for revenge.

00:59:16.200 --> 00:59:18.460
Because I want to kill you more than anyone else.

00:59:19.000 --> 00:59:23.670
It's for Xiaotian.

00:59:25.410 --> 00:59:28.910
Go back and kill me.

00:59:29.150 --> 00:59:29.900
I want to die.

00:59:31.660 --> 00:59:33.770
I've been living here for two years.

00:59:33.810 --> 00:59:35.720
I'm a little tired.

00:59:36.020 --> 00:59:40.970
My father has already taken care of me.

01:00:02.520 --> 01:00:04.180
It's better for him to be dead than alive.

01:00:06.460 --> 01:00:08.230
Xiangchuan.

01:00:08.250 --> 01:00:08.530
Yes.

01:00:09.650 --> 01:00:10.450
Carry him down.

01:00:10.830 --> 01:00:11.050
Yes.

01:00:36.910 --> 01:00:38.000
You didn't cry.

01:00:38.680 --> 01:00:39.440
Why should I cry?

01:00:39.620 --> 01:00:44.610
He used his life to tell you

01:00:44.610 --> 01:00:47.050
that Xiaodie is my daughter.

01:00:47.230 --> 01:00:49.040
He wanted to kill me

01:00:49.040 --> 01:00:51.420
because he was afraid that you would kill Xiaodie's father.

01:00:53.320 --> 01:00:53.840
You know everything?

01:00:54.620 --> 01:00:58.020
Because I have always had someone to take care of Xiaodie.

01:00:58.940 --> 01:00:59.600
About Xiaodie...

01:01:00.320 --> 01:01:01.010
I know everything.

01:01:02.850 --> 01:01:04.310
Then why didn't you kill me yesterday?

01:01:08.250 --> 01:01:10.220
Maybe I'm like Ye Xiang.

01:01:10.680 --> 01:01:12.150
In order to laugh,

01:01:13.820 --> 01:01:17.600
I also want to know who the real master is from you.

01:01:17.600 --> 01:01:21.260
I won't tell you.

01:01:22.920 --> 01:01:24.000
You don't have to tell me.

01:01:24.800 --> 01:01:26.120
As long as you can't kill me,

01:01:26.180 --> 01:01:29.960
I'll know who he is in a while.

01:01:32.140 --> 01:01:33.740
Sir, Master Lu Man Tian committed suicide.

01:01:34.100 --> 01:01:54.740
You didn't die, so I'm the only one who died.

01:02:01.440 --> 01:02:03.100
It can't be Zhuo Mouren.

01:02:03.120 --> 01:02:04.920
He was scared.

01:02:05.420 --> 01:02:07.520
How do you know?

01:02:09.000 --> 01:02:10.400
If it wasn't for Meiko,

01:02:10.520 --> 01:02:11.830
we could have left.

01:02:12.370 --> 01:02:12.530
But,

01:02:16.670 --> 01:02:17.660
the friend who was hiding

01:02:17.660 --> 01:02:18.780
should have come out.

01:02:18.960 --> 01:02:24.630
It's a little strange.

01:02:25.720 --> 01:02:27.460
Now, the only person I can trust

01:02:27.460 --> 01:02:29.460
is you who came to kill me.

01:02:32.400 --> 01:02:38.120
Sometimes, I'd rather believe in enemies than in friends.

01:02:38.420 --> 01:02:40.550
You already knew who I was?

01:02:40.630 --> 01:02:42.830
I didn't know.

01:02:43.050 --> 01:02:47.870
I only knew that there was a very famous killer in the martial arts world these years.

01:02:47.870 --> 01:02:51.000
And he killed a lot of people with very high martial arts skills.

01:02:52.260 --> 01:02:53.820
My name is Meng Xing Kun.

01:02:54.000 --> 01:02:58.420
Old man, all the people you're looking for are here.

01:03:03.390 --> 01:03:05.850
Lu Mantian's death must not be revealed

01:03:05.850 --> 01:03:10.710
Because tomorrow morning I will attack Wanpeng

01:03:10.710 --> 01:03:15.110
When a person is most proud

01:03:15.110 --> 01:03:18.250
It is also the most easy time for him to fail

01:03:18.250 --> 01:03:22.400
Tonight, Wanpeng Wang must think that Lu Mantian has won

01:03:22.400 --> 01:03:24.530
So tomorrow morning

01:03:24.530 --> 01:03:26.990
It is also the most proud time for him to forget the punishment

01:03:31.880 --> 01:03:33.480
You go and do an emergency for me

01:03:33.480 --> 01:03:35.910
I have 500 soldiers at Xiaodi's place

01:03:35.910 --> 01:03:38.510
You go to Hudi forest and get him back for me

01:03:38.510 --> 01:03:39.780
This is a secret order

01:03:39.780 --> 01:03:40.230
Sun Nan

01:03:40.230 --> 01:03:40.450
Yes

01:03:40.450 --> 01:03:42.610
Send four special guards to go with Qin Ye

01:03:42.610 --> 01:03:43.010
Yes

01:03:43.010 --> 01:03:43.840
Wen Hao

01:03:43.840 --> 01:03:44.100
Yes

01:03:44.100 --> 01:03:46.110
You immediately summon the four brothers of Eagle, Dragon and Horse

01:03:46.110 --> 01:03:48.030
and equip them all

01:03:48.050 --> 01:03:48.230
Yes

01:03:48.230 --> 01:03:52.550
Xiangchuan

01:03:52.550 --> 01:03:52.870
Yes

01:03:53.020 --> 01:03:54.630
Close the door

01:03:54.630 --> 01:03:54.950
Yes

01:04:06.360 --> 01:04:25.730
Come with me. I'll take you to a place you've never been before.

01:05:01.340 --> 01:05:05.510
This box contains the list of the 380 branches of the Longmeng Gang.

01:05:05.510 --> 01:05:11.870
This map is the address of the 380 branches of the Longmeng Gang.

01:05:11.910 --> 01:05:20.770
And these cabinets are not the files of the Longmeng Gang's business and property in other parts of the world.

01:05:20.770 --> 01:05:26.880
On the other hand, it is the background of the people in charge of these financial affairs and their background.

01:05:27.420 --> 01:05:29.310
There are more things in the gang.

01:05:31.230 --> 01:05:38.120
So everything in this house is also everything of our Longmeng Gang

01:05:38.120 --> 01:05:42.820
Only the Gang Leader can enter this room

01:05:42.820 --> 01:05:46.060
Then why did you bring me in here?

01:05:47.160 --> 01:05:51.640
Because tomorrow morning I'm going to attack Wanpeng Gang

01:05:51.640 --> 01:05:55.550
Of course I can come back with victory

01:05:55.550 --> 01:05:58.120
But everything in the world has a chance

01:05:58.120 --> 01:05:59.870
And I do everything

01:06:00.000 --> 01:06:02.560
Yes, I always have to prepare for the day after tomorrow.

01:06:02.620 --> 01:06:07.220
What's going on?

01:06:07.280 --> 01:06:09.030
My father told you to come here to find a few hundred soldiers?

01:06:09.590 --> 01:06:11.030
Yes, where are they?

01:06:11.510 --> 01:06:14.980
I haven't seen my father since I left home.

01:06:15.040 --> 01:06:16.910
How could he leave a few hundred soldiers with me?

01:06:17.310 --> 01:06:22.050
That's strange. He gave me two secret orders.

01:06:23.850 --> 01:06:25.230
Then open the secret order and take a look.

01:07:04.800 --> 01:07:06.710
Is everything ready outside?

01:07:06.750 --> 01:07:08.000
Yes, everything is ready.

01:07:30.860 --> 01:07:32.240
I'm using the Seven Star Needle.

01:07:32.240 --> 01:07:35.210
You said that the Seven Star Needle doesn't have a cure.

01:07:35.450 --> 01:07:37.740
I also thought that it was only you.

01:07:38.460 --> 01:07:41.830
But I've always been afraid that it was you.

01:07:43.640 --> 01:07:46.520
These are the two wrong things in your life.

01:07:46.520 --> 01:07:48.370
After you doubted me,

01:07:48.650 --> 01:07:51.560
you believed that I was the first one.

01:07:52.880 --> 01:07:53.880
When you thought that it was me,

01:07:54.380 --> 01:07:56.800
you didn't believe that I was the second one.

01:08:01.470 --> 01:08:06.170
Xiangchuan, what did I do wrong to you?

01:08:06.920 --> 01:08:12.620
Nothing, but if you don't die today, I won't be able to replace you.

01:08:13.100 --> 01:08:17.960
It seems that King Wanpeng has already colluded with you.

01:08:18.920 --> 01:08:22.660
Because only a strong enemy like King Wanpeng can make your heart flutter.

01:08:23.080 --> 01:08:29.230
When your son and friends fall one by one,

01:08:31.210 --> 01:08:32.490
you can't ignore me.

01:08:32.550 --> 01:08:35.880
If you don't,

01:08:36.860 --> 01:08:37.220
tonight,

01:08:37.760 --> 01:08:40.060
you will give me the token of Longmen Gang.

01:08:41.020 --> 01:08:43.750
What about Song Jian and Han Tang?

01:08:44.430 --> 01:08:45.740
Except me,

01:08:46.520 --> 01:08:48.540
who else can kill Han Tang in the coffin?

01:08:48.700 --> 01:08:52.170
Who can kill Han Tang behind my back?

01:08:53.350 --> 01:08:53.990
Lu Mantian,

01:08:54.050 --> 01:08:55.680
your uncle.

01:08:56.020 --> 01:08:58.620
He can live.

01:09:00.960 --> 01:09:03.740
I only blame him for using Meng Xinghu

01:09:03.740 --> 01:09:08.660
Wang Kezhan, you also killed a lot of people from Wanpeng

01:09:08.660 --> 01:09:11.120
In order to gain your trust

01:09:11.120 --> 01:09:13.130
What does it mean to sacrifice dozens of people?

01:09:19.520 --> 01:09:22.340
You have a good plan for this

01:09:22.340 --> 01:09:25.030
Of course it's good

01:09:26.880 --> 01:09:29.830
Then tonight we can kill

01:09:32.330 --> 01:09:34.010
Are you sure you can kill me?

01:09:34.290 --> 01:09:36.300
I can definitely kill you

01:09:37.120 --> 01:09:38.880
Because you were hit by the Seven-star Needle

01:09:38.880 --> 01:09:40.240
You can't even dodge it

01:09:45.130 --> 01:09:50.970
The last thing I want to attack Wanpeng Fortress tomorrow

01:09:50.970 --> 01:09:53.900
Is to give you a small token

01:09:53.900 --> 01:09:56.270
The main thing is for you to show up

01:10:00.120 --> 01:10:01.320
Don't tell others all your secrets.

01:10:02.900 --> 01:10:06.400
At least you should keep the last move.

01:10:07.820 --> 01:10:08.820
Because this move

01:10:08.820 --> 01:10:11.910
can save your life at the most important time.

01:10:37.100 --> 01:10:40.710
Don't run! If you get caught in my Seven-Star Formation, I'm not afraid of you running to the sky!

01:10:41.050 --> 01:10:47.600
Lv Yan, how is it going?

01:10:48.240 --> 01:10:49.480
Immediately send someone to dig up the underground tunnel!

01:10:49.800 --> 01:10:50.060
Yes!

01:10:50.390 --> 01:10:53.520
You take someone to the Butterfly Forest to kill Meng Xinghun!

01:10:53.620 --> 01:10:53.840
Yes!

01:10:58.080 --> 01:10:59.970
Report, we've searched inside. Not a single person has been found.

01:11:01.370 --> 01:11:05.170
Let's go to the other side and ask.

01:11:05.900 --> 01:11:06.520
Brother!

01:11:20.920 --> 01:11:23.950
Do you know where the lady on the other side is?

01:11:25.980 --> 01:11:27.440
How would I know?

01:11:28.040 --> 01:11:29.300
Thank you.

01:11:30.320 --> 01:11:30.440
Where?

01:11:30.860 --> 01:11:50.650
Your brother is missing.

01:11:50.930 --> 01:11:54.170
Something happened to me.

01:12:08.480 --> 01:12:08.740
Ma Fangzhong

01:12:08.740 --> 01:12:13.860
You are Ma Fangzhong

01:12:13.860 --> 01:12:15.160
You are Sun Jun

01:12:15.160 --> 01:12:15.380
Yes

01:12:15.380 --> 01:12:16.270
Come down with me

01:12:16.270 --> 01:12:16.510
OK

01:12:41.100 --> 01:12:41.440
Let's go and take a look.

01:12:41.690 --> 01:12:42.820
Hurry up and close the door.

01:12:42.820 --> 01:12:49.280
Is the car ready?

01:12:49.780 --> 01:12:50.480
It's been ready for over a decade.

01:12:51.700 --> 01:12:55.140
Song Jin, go outside and see if there are any people.

01:12:55.220 --> 01:12:55.300
Yes.

01:13:00.160 --> 01:13:00.580
Who did it?

01:13:01.470 --> 01:13:02.350
Lui Xiangchuan

01:13:02.350 --> 01:13:02.630
What?

01:13:05.110 --> 01:13:06.570
Old Wang, there's no one outside

01:13:06.570 --> 01:13:07.600
Okay, remember

01:13:09.190 --> 01:13:12.130
When you get to the small shop at the entrance

01:13:12.130 --> 01:13:14.200
You must get out of the car and ask for directions

01:13:14.200 --> 01:13:14.870
I know

01:13:14.870 --> 01:13:21.800
Old Wang, I bid you farewell today

01:13:22.360 --> 01:13:23.000
See you again

01:13:23.030 --> 01:13:25.990
Thank you for saving my life fifteen years ago

01:13:34.120 --> 01:13:34.540
Don't nag.

01:13:34.980 --> 01:13:41.460
Brother Ma, I'm counting on you.

01:13:42.480 --> 01:13:45.600
Don't worry, I believe in you.

01:13:45.600 --> 01:13:56.770
Is he reliable?

01:13:57.050 --> 01:13:58.350
He's alone.

01:14:00.000 --> 01:14:01.620
He was waiting for food in the water tunnel.

01:14:01.620 --> 01:14:05.390
You say, this kind of person is unreliable.

01:14:05.450 --> 01:14:08.230
How is the police ready?

01:14:09.130 --> 01:14:21.390
Six years old.

01:14:30.510 --> 01:14:40.320
I'm the only one who can help you.

01:15:37.840 --> 01:15:42.720
Yuxia, do you still remember that 18 years ago,

01:15:42.720 --> 01:15:45.720
when you killed that dog officer and was sentenced to death,

01:15:45.980 --> 01:15:48.700
did your wife save me when I came back from the execution?

01:15:49.000 --> 01:15:59.110
I have always dared to take a good revenge for myself.

01:16:00.800 --> 01:16:05.200
Don't cry, don't cry

01:16:05.200 --> 01:16:14.250
No one can know what's going on here

01:16:14.250 --> 01:16:18.410
Yuxia, life is hard to get a single word

01:16:19.970 --> 01:16:25.160
Come on

01:16:34.090 --> 01:16:34.530
I want to eat this.

01:16:35.150 --> 01:16:35.570
What is it?

01:16:36.730 --> 01:16:37.490
Don't make a fuss.

01:16:37.610 --> 01:16:38.130
Listen to me.

01:16:39.980 --> 01:16:41.520
Don't make a fuss.

01:16:42.280 --> 01:16:42.940
Eat it cleanly.

01:16:43.520 --> 01:16:44.420
I want to eat it.

01:16:44.700 --> 01:16:46.160
Have some porridge.

01:16:49.400 --> 01:16:51.930
Your bowl is so big.

01:16:51.970 --> 01:16:52.670
I want to eat yours.

01:16:53.150 --> 01:16:53.710
Don't move.

01:16:53.910 --> 01:16:55.010
Don't move.

01:16:55.170 --> 01:16:55.710
This is mine.

01:16:56.110 --> 01:16:56.830
I want to eat it.

01:16:57.230 --> 01:16:58.640
I'm bigger than you.

01:16:58.860 --> 01:16:59.560
Stop fighting.

01:17:00.090 --> 01:17:01.390
Come on, drink up.

01:17:01.490 --> 01:17:04.660
When you're done drinking, I'll go somewhere else with you.

01:17:04.740 --> 01:17:05.810
Where are you going?

01:17:06.110 --> 01:17:08.800
I'm going somewhere far away.

01:17:09.380 --> 01:17:11.620
It's very beautiful there.

01:17:12.170 --> 01:17:13.190
And after we get there,

01:17:13.630 --> 01:17:17.060
our family will never be separated again.

01:17:20.520 --> 01:17:27.730
You drink too.

01:17:30.640 --> 01:17:31.420
Have another sip.

01:17:32.580 --> 01:17:34.110
You have a sip too.

01:18:11.710 --> 01:18:13.030
Sir, there's a sign of a horse carriage outside

01:18:31.020 --> 01:18:41.460
There is a injured person in my car, could you please give me some water?

01:18:41.720 --> 01:18:42.140
Okay.

01:18:42.660 --> 01:18:52.340
Thank you.

01:18:52.340 --> 01:18:53.260
Thank you.

01:18:53.260 --> 01:18:58.980
Old man, please drink first, we will leave soon.

01:19:02.200 --> 01:19:02.400
Thank you.

01:19:56.170 --> 01:19:57.670
I've done what I have to do

01:20:00.604 --> 01:20:01.244
We're for one.

01:20:32.490 --> 01:20:33.550
There must be someone in the carriage

01:20:33.550 --> 01:20:36.340
Yes, the one who drove the carriage

01:20:36.340 --> 01:20:37.890
even gave him water to drink

01:20:37.890 --> 01:20:39.460
Master Lv, we have searched almost every place

01:20:39.980 --> 01:20:40.980
Can we still be wrong?

01:20:43.170 --> 01:20:43.470
I don't feel at ease

01:20:43.470 --> 01:20:44.770
if I don't find out who his master is

01:20:47.570 --> 01:20:52.170
Who is in there?

01:20:52.230 --> 01:20:52.910
I'm looking for you

01:21:01.630 --> 01:21:03.610
Why are you here too?

01:21:04.390 --> 01:21:07.110
You said that once Master died, you would give me the land of the Happy Land

01:21:07.810 --> 01:21:09.610
and 100,000 taels of gold

01:21:09.910 --> 01:21:15.100
But Master was not killed by Meng Xinghun

01:21:15.100 --> 01:21:18.660
You were not prepared to kill Master

01:21:18.660 --> 01:21:21.510
You were just using Master's heart

01:21:21.510 --> 01:21:25.040
Because you know that only one person can kill Master

01:21:25.040 --> 01:21:26.900
You know everything

01:21:26.900 --> 01:21:29.900
Of course, because...

01:21:30.220 --> 01:21:31.780
We are the same kind of people.

01:21:31.860 --> 01:21:34.180
Aren't you afraid that I won't give it to you?

01:21:35.100 --> 01:21:39.200
No, because I'm the only one who knows what you want.

01:21:40.710 --> 01:21:43.860
And I'm the only one who knows what you want.

01:21:47.680 --> 01:21:55.190
I'll come. I'll come right away.

01:22:28.508 --> 01:22:29.508
Is it written here?

01:22:30.000 --> 01:22:30.280
That's right.

01:22:30.340 --> 01:22:39.880
Go to Shandong Beisheng Temple and get three white candles.

01:22:40.360 --> 01:22:43.500
Light them in the sky and you'll have a light.

01:22:43.600 --> 01:22:44.140
White candles?

01:22:44.680 --> 01:22:45.340
Miss, look!

01:23:00.444 --> 01:23:01.324
Let me do it.

01:23:30.220 --> 01:23:59.220
A few months ago, I had betrayed my father, Meng Xianhuan.

01:24:00.412 --> 01:24:02.292
If I really betray my wife,

01:24:02.332 --> 01:24:03.932
will still be here to support you?

01:24:05.692 --> 01:24:06.692
We will stay here.

01:24:06.972 --> 01:24:08.372
It's all Lao Bo's plan.

01:24:08.860 --> 01:24:10.140
You probably know that.

01:24:10.428 --> 01:24:12.988
There's always a way out.

01:24:15.388 --> 01:24:17.548
Uncle Yi, where is my father now?

01:24:17.756 --> 01:24:18.756
Your father told me.

01:24:19.068 --> 01:24:21.388
Wearing white is a member of the gang.

01:24:21.468 --> 01:24:23.708
Let us wait for him here

01:24:23.996 --> 01:24:24.796
What about now?

01:24:25.020 --> 01:24:25.780
Don't worry.

01:24:25.916 --> 01:24:27.196
No one can kill your wife.

01:24:27.708 --> 01:24:28.708
Even if you're inside.

01:25:00.960 --> 01:25:01.200
Huh?

01:25:37.710 --> 01:25:38.890
There is no cure for the disease.

01:25:38.890 --> 01:25:41.080
I didn't say that

01:25:41.080 --> 01:25:41.760
people with good internal energy

01:25:41.760 --> 01:25:44.250
can't get the nose out.

01:26:05.660 --> 01:26:06.480
with the public.

01:26:49.040 --> 01:26:49.460
Have you thought about it?

01:26:49.620 --> 01:26:50.780
It's not a big deal for us to divide the territory like the Wanpeng Gang.

01:26:53.620 --> 01:26:56.810
Master, this is a 6-4 division.

01:26:57.260 --> 01:26:58.720
We should take advantage of it.

01:27:01.020 --> 01:27:05.580
Lvshan, is there any news of Yi Qianlong and Meng Xinghun in the north?

01:27:06.600 --> 01:27:08.590
No, we have inquired

01:27:08.590 --> 01:27:12.000
These people have been in Shandong for a while

01:27:12.000 --> 01:27:13.560
They will disappear in the future

01:27:13.560 --> 01:27:18.200
But they will find their way here sooner or later

01:27:18.200 --> 01:27:21.350
By the way, when will Wanpengwang arrive?

01:27:22.290 --> 01:27:24.410
Feng Hao is waiting outside

01:27:24.410 --> 01:27:25.940
He will arrive at about 5 o'clock

01:27:40.400 --> 01:27:41.580
This is the King of Wanpeng

01:28:04.220 --> 01:28:05.080
Lord Wanpeng, please

01:28:06.290 --> 01:28:14.520
If you shout so loudly, you will know more than one person

01:28:14.520 --> 01:28:16.940
Who are you?

01:28:16.940 --> 01:28:22.540
Yi Hu

01:28:22.540 --> 01:28:28.280
Meng Xinhun

01:28:30.000 --> 01:28:40.940
It's impossible for you not to die.

01:28:42.760 --> 01:28:43.760
I've told you before.

01:28:44.420 --> 01:28:47.320
There is no absolute truth in the world.

01:28:47.320 --> 01:28:49.270
And it's just a case.

01:28:50.710 --> 01:28:52.810
You're wrong.

01:28:53.050 --> 01:28:55.880
I didn't see your body all day.

01:28:55.900 --> 01:28:58.100
I prepared you to come back all day.

01:29:02.300 --> 01:29:05.650
What are you doing?

01:29:09.020 --> 01:29:12.230
You once taught me

01:29:12.230 --> 01:29:15.040
to make your enemy underestimate you

01:29:15.040 --> 01:29:17.280
but you can't underestimate your enemy

01:29:17.280 --> 01:29:21.120
Now it's your turn to make a mistake

01:29:32.010 --> 01:29:58.560
Feng Hao, the people outside, come in

01:30:00.250 --> 01:30:27.920
The people of the Longmen are doing well.

01:30:28.820 --> 01:30:29.980
Now the people of the Longmen are doing well.

01:30:30.000 --> 01:30:31.160
They are all our men.

01:30:31.520 --> 01:30:35.470
Lv Xiangchuan, you have been following me for so many years.

01:30:35.550 --> 01:30:36.750
You probably have never learned this move.

01:32:04.690 --> 01:32:28.620
You're finally here. I heard that you're the most famous killer in the world.

01:32:30.960 --> 01:32:32.900
I don't know if I can kill Lv Xiangchuan

01:32:32.900 --> 01:32:34.550
How many chances do you think I have?

01:32:35.090 --> 01:32:38.600
I think you have no chance at all

01:32:38.600 --> 01:32:42.580
Because I have never been defeated by others

01:32:43.220 --> 01:32:46.930
Yes, I have never met a person I can't kill

01:32:46.980 --> 01:32:54.410
You are not selling it

01:33:04.540 --> 01:33:05.600
As expected of Xu Chuan.

01:33:06.000 --> 01:33:06.940
You're not bad.

01:33:07.020 --> 01:33:15.120
It's just that you forgot that I have a Tian Luo Pi.

01:33:31.310 --> 01:33:31.850
Oh

01:34:06.330 --> 01:34:06.490
Yeah.

01:34:52.810 --> 01:34:55.790
He is very skilled, but he has never said that he can't use his internal power

01:35:00.320 --> 01:35:01.840
Now you're the only one left.

01:35:01.840 --> 01:35:05.220
Do you want to die by the lantern or die faster?

01:35:05.620 --> 01:35:17.900
Lv Xiangchuan is indeed Lv Xiangchuan.

01:35:41.550 --> 01:35:42.150
Xiangchuan, what's the matter?

01:35:43.040 --> 01:35:43.820
Close the door quickly

01:35:43.970 --> 01:35:49.250
The gold and silver tickets you've prepared

01:35:49.250 --> 01:35:52.980
The 200,000 taels of gold and the 500,000 taels of silver

01:35:52.980 --> 01:35:54.520
are in the back of the wooden box

01:35:54.520 --> 01:35:54.940
Where are they?

01:35:55.620 --> 01:35:56.000
In the back

01:35:56.000 --> 01:35:58.850
That old man is right

01:36:00.860 --> 01:36:02.540
Everything should be prepared in case

01:36:02.540 --> 01:36:05.260
Where's the wine?

01:36:05.280 --> 01:36:06.360
Here it is

01:36:30.280 --> 01:36:42.450
Xia Qing, do you still remember that when we were little, we were hungry together?

01:36:42.450 --> 01:36:44.540
We used to steal and eat together.

01:36:45.370 --> 01:36:46.190
We used to sleep together.

01:36:46.250 --> 01:36:49.440
We spent a lot of cold nights together.

01:36:49.780 --> 01:36:55.450
I still remember that you kept me for more than 20 years.

01:36:55.590 --> 01:36:59.850
Every person must have...

01:37:00.000 --> 01:37:08.000
You are my true friend, so when the time comes, I won't feel lonely, and I will be able to live on

01:37:08.220 --> 01:37:13.890
No, people like you won't have friends

01:37:14.450 --> 01:37:24.620
You don't need to think about leaving, because I have already chosen this place for you

01:37:25.030 --> 01:37:26.430
To be your last stop

01:37:26.480 --> 01:37:27.100
Don't!

01:37:31.280 --> 01:37:35.950
I'm telling you, if you can betray your wife, why can't I betray you?

01:37:37.540 --> 01:37:41.020
And I've already poisoned you just now.

01:37:41.020 --> 01:37:45.920
That bottle of wine, you have to drink it.

01:37:46.120 --> 01:37:48.930
But the cup is different.

01:38:13.530 --> 01:38:17.160
He also said that all the people that Lao Hu wanted to kill, were the ones that should be killed.

01:38:17.610 --> 01:38:19.660
And that he would definitely be able to kill them.

01:38:33.520 --> 01:38:34.100
Miss is here

01:38:34.100 --> 01:38:38.890
Xinkun, come out with me

01:38:38.890 --> 01:38:50.380
Xinkun, there's nothing for you here

01:38:50.380 --> 01:38:52.340
You have to go with Miss

01:38:52.340 --> 01:38:52.840
Why?

01:38:54.170 --> 01:38:59.100
If you stay, maybe one day you'll come to kill me too

01:39:00.000 --> 01:39:02.180
Because there are so many battles in the world, there are so many

01:39:02.180 --> 01:39:08.730
All right, you can leave now

01:39:08.730 --> 01:39:29.130
Yes, because where there is a sword, there is a dead man waiting for the sword

01:39:45.160 --> 01:39:47.420
It seems to be for the sake of fighting for power.

01:40:00.760 --> 01:40:02.040
We'll be right back.
